N F 95257 133737795.84 127132372.6512 132286291.229445 25.300664010624 35521.32691633466 0.049394422311 3765
N O 7459297 10512270008.9 9986238338.3847 10385578376.585467 25.545537671233 36000.9246880137 0.050095958904 292000
R F 3785523 5337950526.47 5071818532.942 5274405503.049367 25.525943857425 35994.029214030925 0.049989278562 148301

